      ],
      "source": {
        "file": "research/p3-current-lone-dog-335/documented-table.html",
        "row": 1,
        "cell": 0,
        "attributes": {
          "colspan": "3"
        },
        "text": "夜晚已经降临。不远处出现了一只裹着披风的安静小狗，它动了动耳朵，抬头望向挂满佣兵识别牌的巨大树木。\n",
        "sha256": "b919e9d4858baf8ab75e86a96dc4b2d309bf1a0c1f229837fd5c39e8d27e676f"
      }
    },
    "scene_ro6_task2_1": {
      "id": "scene_ro6_task2_1",
      "event_id": "dog",
      "choice_ids": [
        "choice_ro6_task2_3",
        "choice_ro6_task2_4"
      ],
      "source": {
        "file": "research/p3-current-lone-dog-335/documented-table.html",
        "row": 3,
        "cell": 0,
        "attributes": {
          "colspan": "2"
        },
        "text": "你找到了它，礼貌地询问它附近是否有可以歇脚的营地。它没有说话也没有看你，你们眼前的丛林一片漆黑，树梢上失去主人的识别牌摇摇晃晃。看起来它已经独自行动很久了。\n",
        "sha256": "ed2d158a4cd25c5fa8281d1aff3aa64e5c81d68282b317c006528b414d694632"
      }
    },
    "scene_ro6_task2_2": {
      "id": "scene_ro6_task2_2",
      "event_id": "dog",
      "choice_ids": [],
      "source": {
        "file": "research/p3-current-lone-dog-335/documented-table.html",
        "row": 5,
        "cell": 0,
        "attributes": {
          "colspan": "2"
        },
        "text": "你没有跟上去，小狗停下来看了看你，似乎在它眼中你与树梢上的识别牌没有什么不同。它抖抖耳朵便离开了。\n",
        "sha256": "5f9df705c5ed39d19d9055787365a691104e63c39612aa8968b5f96d9af9e113"
      }
    }
  },
